{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119093102662-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119093355\"/><p>銀線灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（11月19日）宣布，由於大浪關係，西貢區的銀線灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:43:53.976723+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T01:31:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T05:57:15.038382+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T01:37:27.849572+00:00","content_hash":"9eeafe5ddfcbea1dd2c0f87287930669e45a3f611aee7724e2099399ba218253","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:43:53.976723+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}